ing":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nobserved in a project upgraded from 4.5.1 to 4.6 beta 3\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.beta3.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9144) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-4790 CPU @ 3.60GHz (8 threads) - 31.93 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nI'm using [Ansol's Sky++ shader](https://godotshaders.com/shader/sky-sorta/) in my project and when I upgraded from 4.5.1 to 4.6 beta 3 it flooded my console with somewhere between 5,800-10,800 errors in the output tab, as far as I can tell there's no actual error with the shader but something with the rendering and environment source code\n\nI really don't know what could be causing this but it appears to just be each line of the shader outputted as an error multiple times over and it seems to come from the environment's sky.cpp source script\n\nI've also tested it with other sky shaders and it only seems to happen with ansol's sky++ shader for whatever reason\n\nwith the guidance of the godot discord I've tried\n- clearing the shader cache\n- deleting the .godot folder\n\nneither of which have worked\n\n<img width=\"770\" height=\"244\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/483ceb9c-453c-4d49-981c-b038bfd8baae\" />\n<img width=\"1221\" height=\"879\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/efd3e77e-5129-4269-b2e8-6f401f3687a1\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nfollowed the steps in the sample project https://github.com/AndreySoldatov/Godot-Sky-Plus-Plus in any version from 4.4 - 4.5.1 and then upgrade to 4.6 beta 3\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A \n\nI did replicate it in a blank project but because it's a large shader the zip is 30mb, just fork the example project above it's also present there from my testing","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser